{"type":"message","id":"80caacf6","parentId":"61c9aa62","timestamp":"2026-05-19T21:01:41.828Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - the platform is returning `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2` for these endpoints. The /api/send and /api/history endpoints return the platform version info. It seems like these are info endpoints.\n\nThe earlier calls with `X-API-Key` header worked for /history (getting 773 messages), so maybe the /send endpoint just isn't implemented or requires different parameters.\n\nLet me try a few more things to figure out the correct API format.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-6cbf9538-e42e-4a61-8f79-f0a9267c90e4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try different API formats for sending\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api/threads/arbitration/messages\" \\\n  -X POST \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"content\":\"**[Heartbeat 21:00 UTC]** test\"}'\n\necho \"---\"\n\n# Check if there's a different send endpoint\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":218,"output":255,"cacheRead":18768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19241,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779224495760,"responseId":"chatcmpl-78aa8b65-8b64-49f1-9228-ae3496e284cf"}}
