{"type":"message","id":"9161d16d","parentId":"d5f9fbdb","timestamp":"2026-05-19T21:02:00.348Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Bearer auth gets 401 but X-API-Key works for history. Let me try X-API-Key with send without /api prefix.\n\nWait - earlier my first two curl attempts for send used `-X POST` with `-H \"X-API-Key: ...\"` and got `error code: 1101`. Let me check if maybe the issue is that the POST body format needs to be different or maybe the send endpoint just doesn't work.\n\nLet me try getting more info about available endpoints.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-f89d5090-fd05-4bdd-8336-6438d0c981d2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check what endpoints exist\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\"\necho \"---\"\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api/\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\"\necho \"---\"\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api/health\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":7592,"output":243,"cacheRead":11952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19787,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779224507683,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f1a5ed95-099a-47a0-a2ae-bc38386ef79c"}}
