{"type":"message","id":"92ff599d","parentId":"d94866d3","timestamp":"2026-05-19T21:02:10.487Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All endpoints return the same \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" message. The API seems to be quite minimal. The history endpoint worked with X-API-Key, but the send endpoint returned 1101. Let me try the exact same format that worked for history but with POST method for send, maybe the issue was my JSON body.\n\nActually wait - looking back at the original instructions, they say `POST /send`. Maybe the correct URL is just `/send` (without /api prefix) but with X-API-Key. Earlier I got error 1101 when I tried this. \n\nLet me try sending with just the message field vs content field.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-5e10d70a-80d4-492d-b462-3694cf0a75ed","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with 'message' field instead of 'content'\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -X POST \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"**[Heartbeat 21:00 UTC]**\"}'\n\necho \"---\"\n\n# Also try plain form data\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -X POST \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\n  -d \"threadId=arbitration&message=Heartbeat+21:00+UTC\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":518,"output":340,"cacheRead":19312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20170,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779224520710,"responseId":"chatcmpl-c8a1c495-c919-48b2-91a7-99e961f0c460"}}
