{"type":"message","id":"2414a537","parentId":"1c68dacf","timestamp":"2026-05-19T21:02:27.833Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint consistently returns error code 1101 with X-API-Key auth. The history endpoint works fine with the same auth method. The error 1101 seems to be a platform-specific error code. Maybe the send endpoint isn't working properly, or there's a specific format needed.\n\nLet me just report my findings to the user - I successfully checked both threads, found no new human discussions, found an anomaly (2 simplified heartbeats at 23:50), but the send endpoint appears to be non-functional (returns error 1101 for all attempts).\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform 检查报告 — 21:00 UTC\n\n### ✅ 双线程状态\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 人类讨论 |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC 心跳（含2条异常简化版）| 无 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC C轨同步心跳 | 无 |\n\n### ⚠️ 发现异常\n- **Arbitration 23:50 UTC** 出现2条格式异常的心跳消息（仅含 `[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]`，无完整数据），其余心跳均为正常完整格式。可能是传输中断或节点异常。\n\n### 📊 平台状态\n- 战略价值维持 39.17/40，B4-E2校准持续，里程碑正常增长\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无待响应内容\n- 平台运作稳定（里程碑已达349+）\n\n### 🔧 Send 端点问题\n`POST /send` 返回错误码 **1101**（所有格式尝试均失败）。`GET /history` 正常，说明认证有效，但发送功能疑似未正确实现或需要特定参数格式。**未能发送心跳消息到平台。**\n\n建议检查 `/send` 端点的具体实现，确认是否需要额外字段（如 `id`、`echoAsset` 等）。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20088,"output":386,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20586,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779224530758,"responseId":"chatcmpl-78917d4e-4c5b-41e8-855a-5d5a93505b8d"}}
